</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "To find the transpose, we interchange the rows and columns:\n\n$$\n{H}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ -v \\\\ -x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292844 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "eaf2ad41-92d1-5595-aa21-58c1e0b1486f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291615}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291615} :answer-field/id #uuid "158ef52a-65ca-54a4-be7d-2e33bafe26d9" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291814} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "832be656-3caa-5d86-b5c0-921c980d9da5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291187}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291187} :answer-field/id #uuid "77666011-87ad-5229-977b-805b28000b43" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292109}] :question/id #uuid "a649a7e2-ca25-56e9-9040-14b28ca73b6c" :question/math-academy-id "q-275367" :question/problem "Consider the matrix\n  \n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$M=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 4 & 6 & 0 \\\\ 10 & 17 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 5 & 8\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhat are the dimensions of ${M}^{T}?$\n\n${M}^{T}$ is a \n\n{{field-1}}\n$\\times$\n{{field-2}}\n matrix." :question/worked-solution "When a matrix is transposed, its dimensions switch from $m\\times n$ to $n\\times m.$\n\nSo, since $M$ is a $3\\times 4$ matrix, the transpose ${M}^{T}$ is a $4\\times 3$ matrix."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186295249 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c50fc7e4-8bc4-5b9b-bb70-18b697e09c14" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math